# save: 29-DungeonM
# Phone, Mach Pizza, a small pizza; the courier walks in ~10000 frames later, $48, Yes
# ignore: ent8\..*
# ignore: near
# The courier (slot 9, script 500) starts with MOVEMENT_CMD_SET_NPC_ID $051F, which goes
# through SET_DIRECTION: ENTITY_DIRECTIONS holds $051F until he walks; the port's 8-bit
# directions[] keeps $1F (cr_movement_cmd_set_npc_id)
# ignore: ent9\.dir
flag 11 1
---
press A; wait 30; press A; wait 60; press A; wait 60
press DOWN 3; wait 10; press A; wait 100
press A; wait 80
press A; wait 80
press A; wait 50; press A; wait 60
wait 10880
press A; wait 60
wait 10; press A; wait 60; press A; wait 200
